world  spring and gravity cascade side striker revision

-- Gravity is the built-in 9.81 m/s².
-- Every body starts with zero velocity and zero spin.
-- This revision is not yet simulation-verified.
-- Auxiliary passive mechanisms are explicit.
-- Ring liners have a 0.16 m inscribed clear aperture.

